  m_text: 'Head Soccer is a 2D arcade football game developed by

    <color=#FFD133>Tomer
    Yad Shalom</color> and <color=#FFD133>Guy Yad Shalom</color>.

    We built it
    out of our love for football and a desire to recreate

    the fun of the original
    Head Soccer, with our own twist.'
